| CHIP OVERVIEW                                                                        |
| • Every transistor cluster is represented as a region, like a vintage CPU die.       |
| • Safety logic and Tama arithmetic logic coexist as separate silicon neighborhoods.  |
| • Carry chain, latch pairs, XOR blocks, and sensor matrix all appear as chip blocks. |
| • No load, no heater — this is purely the logic/safety brain.                        |
